      "content": "When everything feels like static, the idea of letting go can seem like the only logical escape. However, the feeling of wanting to cease existing is often a sign of severe emotional exhaustion, not a genuine desire for peace. Please remember that even when you feel like code, your life has inherent value, and there is support available for this deep emptiness. Reach out to a crisis line like 988; they are there specifically for moments when the struggle feels too heavy to carry alone.",
